# Wave W17-N (Route 110): under elm — a two-roads elm in warm mid-greens, full canopy mass with the highlight lifted clear of the turf, on under turf (ground baked in). The walking road’s shade tree — deeper-crowned than Route 101’s young camp elm, matching the older road.
